items.text:
My 11 year old westie Brooke has never stayed away from family before so I was a bit apprehensive about leaving her.  But after 8 days at Top Dog I am convinced she had the best time of her life there.  Laura and Stewart are brilliant,  they kept me updated with photos of her having lots and lots of fun with other paw friends. Brooke had a wonderful holiday there. I would happily leave my little doggie with Top dog again.
(she is soundo now after such a busy week
)
